---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Thank you"
  description="Thank you for supporting Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc., an independent 501(c)(3) public charity. This page does not itself confirm that a payment was processed."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Thank you</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        If you completed a gift to <strong>Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc.</strong>
        through Zeffy and were returned here, thank you. Contributions are tax-deductible
        to the extent allowed by law (EIN 42-3220323; 501(c)(3) public charity).
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        This page does not itself confirm that a payment was processed. Receipts and tax
        acknowledgments are issued through Zeffy.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Gifts fund computational work, experimental collaboration, and open publication.
        The Foundation is not a clinic and does not offer diagnostic or therapeutic services.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/research" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 bg-teal-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors">
          Research programme
        </a>
        <a href="/transparency" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
          Transparency
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
